Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(permission):=20=E5=AE=A1=E6=9F=A5=20Git=20b?=
 =?UTF-8?q?undle=20=E5=BD=92=E6=A1=A3=E5=88=9B=E5=BB=BA?=
